I have also passed through \"Yonao to Chumu\" created by Mikoto.\n\nCharacter Details\nMei Iruka 32 years old / 173cm\nStraight black hair / Pink eyes / Suspended eyebrows\n-Image Color: Old Orchid #E3ADC1\n-Boss. He likes his subordinates, but he is not a good boss. He claims to be laissez-faire. He is good with guns.\n-He is a heavy smoker and has a very sweet tooth.\n-His first name is usually \"I\" but becomes \"I\" when he is in front of someone he is comfortable with. He always looks fearless, but in front of Sangemon, he looks calm.\n-He is not good with cats.\n\nSangaimon Tianning 31 years old / 168 cm\nBrown cat hair / Blue-green eyes / Cat eyes\n-Image Color: Spray Green#A3D3DD\n-Subordinate. In charge of mechanics. Dexterous and efficient with his hands. He is also good with handguns and has good agility. Short-distance runner.\n-A non-smoker with a sweet tooth. He keeps a desk stocked with candies and chocolates. He only tolerates Iruka's cigarettes at the very last minute.\n-He has a good face (APP16). However, he lacks delicacy in some areas, so he is not the type to last long with a girlfriend.\n-She is good with people. She also gives a cat-like impression to senpai whom she has taken to with open arms.\n\nRelationships.\nHe has given her a duplicate key.\nThey are two younger people who are no match for an older person, and they have said that they will eventually tie the knot.\n\nComposition, etc.\nThe composition, facial expressions, and clothing are all up to you. The closer they are, the better.\n\nUsage\nFor viewing\nUse as a social networking icon\nSharing with partner PL\n\nURL】 【Resource URL\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1fOh9IgjSApFi4WZdJp2AtH7DUPoh0Dpe\n\nIf there are any discrepancies in the amount or materials, I would appreciate it if you could resend/cancel the request. Thank you for your consideration.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1fOh9IgjSApFi4WZdJp2AtH7DUPoh0Dpe", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path"